{
  "movie_id": 515200002,
  "subtitles": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "start_time": 4.2,
      "end_time": 5.9,
      "text": "So this is the sea..."
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start_time": 7.8,
      "end_time": 8.8,
      "text": "Eek...!"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start_time": 11.2,
      "end_time": 13.7,
      "text": "Are you all right, Lady Emilia?"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start_time": 14.0,
      "end_time": 16.0,
      "text": "Ah... Thank you, Rem"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start_time": 17.0,
      "end_time": 19.1,
      "text": "...Oh my? Where did Ram go?"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start_time": 19.4,
      "end_time": 22.0,
      "text": "If you're looking for my sister, she's over there"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start_time": 23.1,
      "end_time": 28.3,
      "text": "Wow, that's amazing. It seems Ram is a natural at enjoying the sea!"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start_time": 28.9,
      "end_time": 34.0,
      "text": "Yes. Even in such a vast ocean, my sister is always a natural at everything"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start_time": 34.3,
      "end_time": 37.2,
      "text": "As for me, I'm still a little scared..."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start_time": 37.7,
      "end_time": 39.7,
      "text": "Found an opening! Eigh!"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start_time": 40.0,
      "end_time": 41.0,
      "text": "Waaagh!"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start_time": 42.0,
      "end_time": 45.4,
      "text": "Geez... Puck! It seems pranks are all you can think of!"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start_time": 47.6,
      "end_time": 53.0,
      "text": "...Sea water really is salty, just like Subaru-kun said"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start_time": 53.4,
      "end_time": 54.7,
      "text": "That was not a prank"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start_time": 54.9,
      "end_time": 58.3,
      "text": "Subaru said this is the kind of etiquette you have at the beach, remember?"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start_time": 58.6,
      "end_time": 60.5,
      "text": "Come on, Lia, you try it"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start_time": 60.9,
      "end_time": 63.5,
      "text": "Really? Then let me..."
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start_time": 64.0,
      "end_time": 65.7,
      "text": "Eyah!"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start_time": 67.3,
      "end_time": 69.0,
      "text": "So this is the etiquette of the beach..."
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start_time": 69.4,
      "end_time": 73.0,
      "text": "If this is something that Subaru-kun said, then Rem has no reason to hesitate..."
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start_time": 73.5,
      "end_time": 75.1,
      "text": "Hahh!"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start_time": 83.0,
      "end_time": 87.4,
      "text": "THE BEACH! It's the BESTTTTTTT!"
    }
  ],
